        },
        {
          "text": "Maro Odu Dansa tanaatiifi gara na ergani, ato anini amma hid'aansa keesa jiraad'ele. Tanaafi Waaqa naa kad'ad'a, aka anini jabeese dubbad'u, akuma tolchu male.",
