        {
          "text": "Tikikoni, oboleesa keennafi hojattuuni teenna ta d'uga huji Aabbo keesa, odu tiyya ch'ufa isaniti odeesa, aka isani waan anini keesa jiru hubattani. ",
          "type": "text",
